hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"341","Tez raftari se safar karne ke bare mein bab: Ibn al-Musaffa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Mughirah ne humein khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Ubayd se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab apne ghazwon aur sarayon se wapas lautte to zade-rah ki kami ki wajah se tez chalte the."
